{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761340/extras/discordnew.png?t=1749031037\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warning: This game contains jumpscares.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warning: This game is based on the universe of another game by the same creator, Doll Impostor. Dolls, boxes, robots, and other elements share the same models, names, and assets. When Doll Impostor is updated, this game will also receive updates, such as new dolls, boxes, and more.</h2><br><strong>This demo contains 5-day trial and no extra modes</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Mode: Your 30-Day Trial Begins</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761340/extras/1.gif?t=1749031037\" /><br>You\u2019ve been hired on a provisional basis. You have 30 days to prove your efficiency at Doll Inc.<br>Each day gets harder. Every mistake... more costly.<br>Will you become part of the system \u2014 or be discarded like another faulty unit?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classify Quickly: Repair or Production?</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761340/extras/2.gif?t=1749031037\" /><br>Inspect dolls on the conveyor, detect visual or data errors, and decide their fate.<br>There are no breaks, no second chances.<br>Repair or produce... and do it fast!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Handle Malfunctions and Maintenance</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761340/extras/3.gif?t=1749031037\" /><br>The factory isn\u2019t perfect. Blackouts, blockages, and power failures can occur.<br>Leave your station, head to maintenance, restart systems, or check the flow.<br>Then hurry back \u2014 or lose control.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Doll Inc.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761340/18de129152cc1b8c15ff879ec32b9b11d